<!-- 隐私授权弹窗：符合微信平台运营规范3.4，收集用户信息前需取得用户同意 -->
<view class="privacy-mask" wx:if="{{showPrivacy}}">
  <view class="privacy-modal">
    <view class="privacy-title">用户协议与隐私政策</view>
    <view class="privacy-desc">感谢您使用京采接单。我们非常重视您的个人信息和隐私保护。请您阅读并同意以下协议后继续使用：</view>
    <view class="privacy-links">
      <text class="link" bindtap="handleOpenUserAgreement">《用户服务协议》</text>
      <text class="link" bindtap="handleOpenPrivacyPolicy">《隐私政策》</text>
    </view>
    <view class="privacy-tip">我们将在您同意后收集必要信息以提供配送管理服务，包括：账号信息、联系信息、位置信息等。详见隐私政策。</view>
    <view class="privacy-btns">
      <button class="privacy-btn secondary" bindtap="handleOpenPrivacyContract">查看微信隐私指引</button>
      <button id="agree-privacy-btn" class="privacy-btn primary" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="handleAgreePrivacy">同意并继续</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class='flex-column'>
  <back-navbar style="height: {{navBarHeight}}rpx;" title="邀请码认证" avatar="/images/logo.jpg" button-text="返回" bindnavbuttontap="toBack"></back-navbar>
  
  <view class='flex-column p-20' style="margin-top: {{navBarHeight}}rpx;">
    <!-- <view class="flex-column center-content">
      <view class='word'>京采接单</view>
      <view class="small gray" style="margin-bottom: 40rpx;">专业配送商户专用版</view>
    </view> -->

    <view class="invite-container1">
      <view class="invite-title">请输入邀请码</view>
      <view class="invite-desc">请使用有效的邀请码进行认证</view>
      
      <view class="input-container">
        <input 
          class="invite-input" 
          type="text" 
          placeholder="请输入邀请码" 
          value="{{inviteCode}}" 
          bindinput="onInviteCodeInput"
          bindconfirm="verifyInviteCode"
          maxlength="50"
          disabled="{{isVerifying}}"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="btn-container">
        <button 
          class="verify-btn {{isVerifying ? 'disabled' : ''}}" 
          bindtap="verifyInviteCode"
          disabled="{{isVerifying}}"
        >
          {{isVerifying ? '验证中...' : '验证邀请码'}}
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>









